note as BIZ
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  Separates the human person from login accounts and from domain roles. A person
  may be a patient, practitioner, related person, representative or operator and
  may have zero, one or multiple authentication accounts over time. Patient and
  practitioner records therefore remain valid for newborns, emergencies, imported
  records, external professionals and deceased persons without portal access.
end note

